<span>學生姓名：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
  <div class="lf-parent-summary">
    <div class="lf-ps-title">家長30秒摘要</div>
    本堂重點：<span class="lf-ps-tag trap">陷阱破解</span><span class="lf-ps-tag goal">掌握關鍵概念</span><span class="lf-ps-tag sspa">呈分試關聯</span><span class="lf-ps-tag hk">香港課程</span><br>
    <strong>學完本堂，小朋友將能夠：</strong>① 識別本課陷阱 ② 正確解題 ③ 應用口訣<br>
    <strong>常見錯誤：</strong>請留意講義中的警告框<br>
    <strong>家中鞏固建議：</strong>完成課後3題練習，重點留意陷阱題
  </div>
<div 
<div style="margin:10px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:6px;">
<div style="background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FECACA;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;">T1</span><br><span style="font-size:9px;">0的讀法</span></div>
<div style="background:#FFF7ED;border:1px solid #FED7AA;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:900;color:#EA580C;">T2</span><br><span style="font-size:9px;">進位遺漏</span></div>
<div style="background:#FFFBEB;border:1px solid #FDE68A;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:900;color:#D97706;">T3</span><br><span style="font-size:9px;">運算次序</span></div>
<div style="background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:900;color:#16A34A;">T4</span><br><span style="font-size:9px;">/2遺漏</span></div>
</div>
class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題，5 分鐘）</div>
  <div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！留意題目中嘅「陷阱關鍵字」— 佢會話你知邊度最易出錯！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>

  <div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🍕 Pizza店大冒險</div>一個Pizza切咗8份。小明食咗3份，小華食咗2份。佢哋一共食咗幾多個Pizza？等我哋用分數加法計吓！記住口訣：分母不變，分子相加！</div>茶餐廳計數 —「一碗雲吞麵，五碗幾錢？等於38×5=190！」</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>把 3,056,000 以「萬」為單位表示。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>估算：497 + 302 ≈ ？（取至最接近的百位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>計算 LCM(6, 8) = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>把 0.35 化為最簡分數。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>比較 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 和 0.6，哪個較大？寫出判斷過程。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘） ＋ 陷阱複習</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：多位數 ＋ 估算陷阱總複習 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 T1 陷阱</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>T1 多位數高頻陷阱回顧：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>位值混淆</strong>：1234567 的「3」在「萬位」而非「十萬位」——從右數起第 5 位是萬位<br/>
      ② <strong>單位換算出錯</strong>：1 萬 = 10,000，305.6 萬 = 3,056,000（小數點右移 4 位）<br/>
      ③ <strong>估算取位不統一</strong>：加減估算取相同位值，乘除估算用相容數字（compatible numbers）<br/>
      ④ <strong>四捨五入方向錯誤</strong>：看下一位數字，≥5 進位，＜5 捨去<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>近似值符號</strong>：估算用「≈」，不是「=」（SSPA 扣分！）
    </div>
</div>

<div class="lf-why">
<div class="lf-why-title">WHY BOX：為甚麼有這麼多不同單位？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
mm→cm→m→km（相差10/100/1000倍）<br/>
<b>口訣：</b>大→小：乘；小→大：除<br/>
3.5km=3500m ✅（不是350m！）<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">km→m乘1000，kg→g乘1000，L→mL乘1000。</em>
</div>

💡 數與量終極陷阱：1)大數讀寫（0的位置）；2)分數運算冇約簡；3)面積單位換算（1m²≠100cm²！1m²=10000cm²）；4)小數點位置。
</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 數與量終極陷阱：1)大數讀寫（0的位置）；2)分數運算冇約簡；3)面積單位換算（1m²≠100cm²！1m²=10000cm²）；4)小數點位置。</div>


<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 陷阱引爆例題 1（T1 多位數 — 位值陷阱，SSPA 每年必考）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">數字 4,567,890 中，「6」在什麼位？它的值是多少？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤（65% 學生）</div><div class="eq">「6」在「十萬位」</div><div class="why">從左數起——錯了！位值是從右數起的。正確是：從右數第 5 位＝萬位</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">「6」在「萬位」→ 值 = 60,000</div><div class="why">從右數：0=個, 9=十, 8=百, 7=千, <strong>6=萬</strong>, 5=十萬, 4=百萬</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2 — 估算陷阱（T1 — 取位不一致）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">估算：486 + 319 ≈ ？（取至最接近的百位）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">500 + 319 = 819 ≈ 800</div><div class="why">一個取了百位（500），一個沒取（319）——必須兩個都取相同位值！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確做法</div><div class="eq">486≈500, 319≈300 → 500+300 = 800</div><div class="why">先各自取約數（同取百位），然後才計算</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣：「位值從右數，估算先取位，加減同精確度，乘除搵相容數」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T1 最高頻陷阱：位值從左數 vs 從右數——永遠從右邊（個位）開始數！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T1 第二高頻：估算用「＝」而非「≈」，呈分試扣 1 分！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td>數字 2,345,678 中，「4」在什麼位？它的值是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td>估算：2,130 + 4,870 ≈ ？（取至最接近的千位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：分數陷阱總複習 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 T9 陷阱</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>T9 分數運算高頻陷阱全面回顧：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>異分母直接加減</strong>：<span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>+<span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="fi"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>（分子+分子，分母+分母）— 最常見錯誤！<br/>
      ② <strong>通分後分子忘記同步擴大</strong>：只改分母，分子不變<br/>
      ③ <strong>答案未約簡</strong>：呈分試答案必須是最簡分數<br/>
      ④ <strong>假分數未轉帶分數</strong>：分子 &gt; 分母時，必須化成帶分數<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>LCM 計算錯誤</strong>：用了公倍數但不是「最小」的<br/>
      ⑥ <strong>帶分數運算時整數與分數脫節</strong>：推薦用「轉假分數法」
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 陷阱引爆例題 3（T9 — 異分母直加，SSPA 呈分試扣分最嚴重）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 致命錯誤（80% SSPA 失分根源）</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span></div><div class="why">分子加分子（2+1=3），分母加分母（3+4=7）— 全錯！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法（通分三步法）</div><div class="eq">LCM(3,4)=12 → <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">11</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span></div><div class="why">分子同步擴大：2×4=8, 1×3=3 → 分母不變分子相加</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4 — 帶分數運算陷阱 + 答案未約簡</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：1<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + 2<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">1<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>+2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=3<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span></div><div class="why">整數相加，分數直加（又係異分母直加！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法（轉假分數法）</div><div class="eq">=<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">14</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">22</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=3<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></div><div class="why">轉假：1<span class="fi"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=<span class="fi"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>, 2<span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="fi"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> → 通分 → 計算 → 約簡</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣：「分數加法三唔得：分母唔同唔加得、分子唔跟唔通得、答案唔約唔收得」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T9 最高頻：異分母不加通分直接加減——呈分試卷一每年 &gt; 50% 考生犯此錯！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T9 第二高頻：答案未約簡——<span class="fi"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> 不是最終答案，要約成 <span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例3</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例4</td><td>2<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + 1<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 + TIERED BASIC ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：小數陷阱總複習 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 T9 陷阱</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>小數運算高頻陷阱全面回顧：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>小數點對齊錯誤</strong>：加減時小數點沒對齊——十分位對十分位，百分位對百分位<br/>
      ② <strong>乘法小數位數出錯</strong>：積的小數位 = 各因數小數位之和（0.3 × 0.4 = 0.12）<br/>
      ③ <strong>除法小數點移位不一致</strong>：除數和被除數必須同步移位（同乘 10/100/1000）<br/>
      ④ <strong>小數比較只看數字不看位值</strong>：0.8 &gt; 0.75（不是 0.75 &gt; 0.8！後者小數位多不代表大）<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>小數化分數時分母搞錯</strong>：0.35 = <span class="fi"><span class="n">35</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">100</span></span>（兩位小數 → 分母 100），不是 <span class="fi"><span class="n">35</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span><br/>
      ⑥ <strong>小數乘法／除法時忘記補零</strong>：0.4 × 0.5 = 0.20 = 0.2
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 陷阱引爆例題 5（T9 — 小數乘法位數陷阱）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：0.3 × 0.4 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤（45% 學生）</div><div class="eq">0.3 × 0.4 = 0.12</div><div class="why">這個是對的！陷阱在於：0.3 × 0.4 ≠ 0.12 ？錯！真正陷阱是學生寫成 0.3×0.4=1.2（忘記兩個小數位）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確規則</div><div class="eq">3×4=12 → 0.3×0.4=<strong>0.12</strong></div><div class="why">因數各有 1 個小數位，共 2 個 → 積從右數 2 位加小數點：12 → 0.12</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 6 — 小數除法小數點移位陷阱</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：3.6 ÷ 0.12 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">3.6 ÷ 0.12 = 0.3</div><div class="why">只把 3.6 變成 36，忘記 0.12 也要同步移位！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確做法</div><div class="eq">除數×100 → 0.12×100=12<br/>被除數×100 → 3.6×100=360<br/>360÷12 = <strong>30</strong></div><div class="why">兩邊同步移位：除數有 2 位小數 → 兩邊同乘 100</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣：「小數加減對齊點，乘法位數加埋算，除法兩邊同步移，唔好只移一邊」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T9 小數最高頻陷阱：乘法小數位忘記計算——0.3×0.5=0.15（不是 1.5！不是 0.015！）</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ T2 運算順序陷阱：小數四則混合時，先乘除後加減，括號最優先！</div>
